            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on the job. For killing mold, RMR-141, an EPA-registered quaternary ammonium fungicide, is our top pick. For shower grout and tile, a bleach spray such as Clorox Plus Tilex works fastest. For stains, RMR-86. For prevention and large areas, Concrobium Mold Control. Outdoors on siding and decks, Wet & Forget Outdoor."
